Package: easel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: webp-pixbuf-loader
Description: simple paint program for GNOME in the spirit of classic Paint
 Easel has the tools and workflow of the old Microsoft Paint of Windows XP,
 built with GTK 4 and libadwaita: pencil, brush, airbrush, eraser, fill, text,
 lines, curves, shapes and selections, with unlimited undo and redo.
 .
 It opens and saves PNG, JPEG, BMP, TIFF and WebP pictures.
